  "description": "A small neighborhood in Seoul, 2004. Jeong-Hui, a child called a “monster” simply because his whole body is red Despite being teased by others, Jeong-Hui, whose heart is clearer and purer than anyone else’s, spends his days running all sorts of errands for his stepfather and mother. Then, at the age of eight, when Jeong-Hui goes to school for the first time, he realizes: My family is… somehow strange.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
